  unitName: Time Lord Claris
  unitId: 30042
  unitNumber: 283
  description: A geomancer once active in the ruined Vriksha Duchy. Despite her gaining
    the impressive power of being able to manipulate time, there exists very little
    proof of it. Record of Claris's efforts was, however, found in the diary of a
    girl from a small village. It was recorded that she had wielded great magical
    power, like that of the gods. The young girl wrote of her in her diary, "It's
    like she had that power inside of her all along."
  summonDesc: I already knew you were<br>going to summon me.<br>I know your future,
    too...
  fusionDesc: Power is to be used when<br>necessary and in moderation.<br>You agree,
    don't you?
  evoDesc: I evolved because<br>I now know what it means <br>to manipulate time.
  element: 3
  rarity: 2
